  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the implementation of the Amazon Ecosystem-based Conservation Vision to the benefit of local communities and the preservation of ecosystem services in the Amazon region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is that by 2020, protected area systems in the Amazon Biome are increasing ecosystem resilience to the effects of climate change and maintaining the provision of environmental goods and services benefiting biodiversity, local communities and economies.</narrative>
